    c "我会告诉她的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:405
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_191fa270:

    # e "You've managed to make me even more confused."
    e "你反而让我更加困惑了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:406
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_355cda68:

    # e "Here I was thinking I was some kind of freak, but instead you've gone ahead and acted on your impulses which I tried to repress for so long."
    e "我原本还以为自己是个怪胎，结果你倒好，直接把我压抑这么久的冲动付诸行动了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:407
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_81bbc5bc:

    # c "Do you need some time to think?"
    c "你需要些时间思考吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:409
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_bcb00d23:

    # e "I...{w} I don't know."
    e "我…{w}我不知道。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:410
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_d497a453:

    # e "I need you."
    e "我需要你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:411
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_d0c4b606:

    # e "Ugh, I'm sounding desperate aren't I?"
    e "呃，我听起来很绝望对吧？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:412
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_28f78377:

    # e "I should have said something way, way earlier."
    e "我早就该说出来的，早就该说了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:413
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_5fdffee0:

    # e "Confessed my feelings when you were leaving for the Academy."
    e "在你离开去学院时，我表白了心意。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:414
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_703fb785:

    # c "I'm not sure I'd have understood you back then."
    c "我不确定当时的我能否理解你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:416
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_bed5dbc1:

    # c "The events on the research station were a revelation in that regard."
    c "研究站发生的事在这方面给了我启示。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:418
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_51eb6594:

    # c "It’s been a slow realization over the past months."
    c "这是过去几个月里慢慢意识到的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:419
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_26f514f4:

    # c "Very much like the fact that I love multiple women at the same time."
    c "就像我同时爱着多个女人这个事实一样。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:421
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_e392fe53:

    # e "I'm happy with your first epiphany, much less so with the second."
    e "我对你的第一个顿悟感到高兴，但对第二个就不那么开心了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:422
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_5173f506:

    # "Céline's voice over the intercom announcing the progress towards the capital interrupted our conversation."
    "瑟琳通过广播宣布前往首都进展的声音打断了我们的谈话。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:424
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_36837bff:

    # e "My head is spinning, I really need to lie down for a while and process all this."
    e "我头晕目眩，真的需要躺一会儿来消化这一切。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:425
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_24366554:

    # c "I understand."
    c "我明白。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:427
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_88910c0b:

    # "Eva took my hand as I was about to turn and leave her quarters."
    "当我正要转身离开她的舱室时，伊娃拉住了我的手。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:429
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_f7499c09:

    # e "Whatever I decide in the end, I'd very much like you to kiss me again."
    e "无论我最终作何决定，此刻我都非常希望你能再次亲吻我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:431
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_bf74a186:

    # "I didn't need much more encouragement and took her in my arms."
    "无需更多鼓励，我便将她拥入怀中。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:433
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_db4dfb6d:

    # "The kiss we exchanged was as passionate as it was longing."
    "我们交换的吻既充满激情又饱含渴望。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:435
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_c85455a9:

    # "When the moment had passed, Eva watched me go, the inner conflict visible in her expression."
    "当那一刻过去，伊娃目送我离去，她脸上明显流露着内心的挣扎。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:436
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_7e108f45:

    # "The way she'd held me as we kissed made me feel hopeful, however, that despite my shocking confession, it might all just work out."
    "然而，她在接吻时拥抱我的方式让我心生希望—尽管我的坦白令人震惊，但一切或许仍有转机。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:439
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_05d1b014:

    # "This didn’t feel like the right opportunity to mention the other women I was involved with."
    "现在似乎不是提及其他与我有关的女性的合适时机。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:440
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_0688765a:

    # "There’d be a time to tell everything, but for now I just wanted to enjoy the happiness we both felt."
    "终有一天会全盘托出，但此刻我只想享受我们共同感受到的欢愉。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:441
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_2fa5bb53:

    # e "I really want you to kiss me now."
    e "我现在真的好想让你吻我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:443
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_bf74a186_1:

    # "I didn't need much more encouragement and took her in my arms."
    "无需更多鼓励，我便将她拥入怀中。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:445
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_db4dfb6d_1:

    # "The kiss we exchanged was as passionate as it was longing."
    "我们交换的吻既充满激情又饱含渴望。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:447
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_f21facb5:

    # e "My head is spinning, I really need to lie down for a while."
    e "我的头有点晕，真的需要躺一会儿。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:448
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_c325bbaa:

    # c "I could keep you company."
    c "我可以陪着你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:449
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_968e0eb8:

    # e "I'd really like that."
    e "我很乐意。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:451
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_23478fd1:

    # "We both sat on her bed and I took her in my arms."
    "我们俩在她床上坐下，我将她拥入怀中。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:452
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_e47df03b:

    # "She fell asleep as I stroked her hair."
    "我轻抚她的头发时，她睡着了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:454
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_2d74cf47:

    # "The way we both took comfort in each other felt changed, surely this was the beginning of a whole new chapter in our relationship."
    "我们彼此慰藉的方式感觉已经不同，这无疑是我们关系全新篇章的开始。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:456
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_3a4fc938:

    # "We were still brother and sister, but on the verge of becoming something more."
    "我们仍是兄妹，但即将跨越到某种更亲密的关系。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:458
translate simplified_chinese ep015_eva_talk_cb959b30:

    # "We were still friends, but on the verge of becoming something more."
    "我们仍是朋友，但即将跨越到某种更亲密的关系。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:469
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_3b0ab1a6:

    # "When I entered my quarters, Jade was already sitting there on the bed."
    "当我走进自己的舱室时，杰德已经坐在床上。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:470
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_818c1206:

    # c "Hey, I was wondering where you'd be."
    c "嘿，我刚才还在想你去哪儿了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:472
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_d12dbfe8:

    # j "I just took a shower, needed to get out of that armor."
    j "我刚冲了个澡，得把那身盔甲脱掉。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:473
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_092ac00e:

    # c "Are you feeling okay?"
    c "你还好吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:475
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_21743fab:

    # j "Not really."
    j "不太好。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:476
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_3697b63f:

    # j "I mean, the way we just ran down all those people back at the encampment..."
    j "我是说，我们之前在营地里那样追杀那些人…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:477
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_b746a18a:

    # j "Ziv shouldn't have refused that order and endangered all of us, but she had the right reasons."
    j "基芙不该违抗命令让我们所有人陷入险境，但她的出发点是好的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:478
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_89aefe22:

    # c "I see."
    c "我明白了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:480
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_66f74cc8:

    # j "Was it absolutely necessary to just shoot on sight?"
    j "有必要一见面就开枪吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:481
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_8884aea2:

    # j "We could have taken prisoners."
    j "我们本可以抓俘虏的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:483
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_a599c474:

    # j "I mean, some of them were barely adults and most of them certainly never held a gun."
    j "我是说，他们中有些人刚成年，而且大多数人肯定连枪都没摸过。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:484
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_aebe09c9:

    # c "As I said, we walked into that forest without a clear assessment of our enemy's strength."
    c "就像我说的，我们进入那片森林时对敌人的实力并没有清晰评估。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:485
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_b539956c:

    # c "I couldn't take any risks, your lives were on the line."
    c "我绝不能冒任何风险，你们的生命危在旦夕。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:487
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_fe6f1e57:

    # j "I know you acted out of concern for us, but still..."
    j "我知道你是出于对我们的关心才这么做的，但是…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:488
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_6685d1ac:

    # c "According to the intel we had, Rhedia's people were terrorists."
    c "根据我们掌握的情报，瑞迪亚的手下都是恐怖分子。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:489
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_9c1b4313:

    # c "There was no doubt in my mind to authorize lethal force."
    c "我毫不犹豫就授权使用致命武力。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:490
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_12806f9a:

    # c "I'd order the same thing again in similar circumstances."
    c "在类似情况下我依然会下达同样的命令。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:492
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_87dea4b9:

    # j "I just...{w} it pains me to see you like this, [p_name_short]."
    j "我只是…{w}看到你这样我很心痛，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:493
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_efe0e8c3:

    # c "Like what?"
    c "什么样？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:494
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_3038f956:

    # j "You've become so ruthless."
    j "你变得如此冷酷无情。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:495
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_95707007:

    # c "I protect the ones I love at all costs."
    c "我不惜一切代价保护我所爱的人。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:497
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_7741887d:

    # j "I appreciate that, but you shouldn't be prepared to pay any price."
    j "我很感激这一点，但你不该准备好付出任何代价。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:498
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_4bcc1a34:

    # j "Once you start being so callous about another being's life, you'll lose yourself for sure."
    j "一旦你对另一个生命的生死变得如此麻木，你肯定会迷失自我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:501
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_dc095ba7:

    # j "I saw the coldness in your eyes when you executed Garomph, and it shocked me."
    j "我目睹了你处决加罗姆夫时眼中的冷漠，这让我震惊。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:502
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_4e2aaeea:

    # j "At first I thought it was a one-time slip, but after you returned from the Jaculus I'm not so sure anymore."
    j "起初我以为那只是一时失态，但自从你从\"翼蛇\"号回来后，我就不那么确定了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:506
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_913c45d6:

    # c "I'm still the same person, Jade, and I live with the choices I've made every day."
    c "我还是同一个人，杰德，我每天都在为我的选择而活。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:508
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_7f2ce9a1:

    # c "Garomph was a piece of trash for what he did with those women."
    c "加罗姆夫对那些女人做的事，他就是个人渣。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:509
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_8ad3677c:

    # c "I'm not proud of killing him, but then again, nobody else interfered with his business."
    c "我并不以杀了他为荣，但话说回来，也没有其他人干涉他的勾当。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:510
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_dbda480c:

    # c "Local law enforcement just stood by and let it all happen for years."
    c "当地执法部门多年来只是袖手旁观，任由这一切发生。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:511
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_b2cef4b4:

    # j "We shouldn't play judge, jury and executioner."
    j "我们不该同时扮演法官、陪审团和行刑者。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:512
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_07dff404:

    # c "Yes, you're right."
    c "是的，你说得对。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:513
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_53afe945:

    # c "But I'm not sure if we have the luxury of choosing all of the time."
    c "但我不确定我们是否总能如此从容地选择。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:515
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_2a5d9eb0:

    # c "The same goes for what happened back in Tand."
    c "坦德星上发生的事情也是如此。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:517
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_4c72984c:

    # c "Tand being a prime example."
    c "坦德星就是个典型例子。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:518
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_cc2f5a89:

    # c "We had bad intel going into a high-risk situation."
    c "我们当时在情报不足的情况下进入了高风险处境。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:519
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_4377db3a:

    # c "But just know that I don't make these decisions lightly."
    c "但你要知道，我做出这些决定绝非轻率。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:520
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_eed581f9:

    # c "I'll bear the guilt and whatever else comes at me."
    c "我会承担这份罪责以及随之而来的一切后果。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:522
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_5fc0eb37:

    # j "Fair enough."
    j "说得对。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:523
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_dd81d4b2:

    # j "But I just worry about you sometimes, [p_name]."
    j "但我有时就是会担心你，[p_name]。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:525
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_deb6869a:

    # "Jade, though still very tense, accepted my embrace."
    "虽然依旧十分紧张，但杰德还是接受了我的拥抱。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:526
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_405ee3bc:

    # "As we both appreciated our closeness, Jade leaned in to me."
    "当我们都沉浸在这份亲密中时，杰德向我依偎过来。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:528
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_548f341f:

    # j "I just don't want to lose the man I love."
    j "我只是不想失去我爱的人。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:529
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_e7a4eea6:

    # c "You won't, I promise."
    c "你不会失去我的，我保证。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:531
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_43a61167:

    # "Jade and I stood there for quite a while, the hum of the Bastard's engine the only audible sound."
    "杰德和我站在那里好一阵子，只有\"私生子\"号引擎的嗡鸣声清晰可闻。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:534
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_73fec01b:

    # c "You're right, maybe I haven't been myself."
    c "你说得对，也许我确实有些失常。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:535
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_05d017f1:

    # c "Heading an entire crew is such a big responsibility."
    c "领导整个船员是这么重大的责任。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:536
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_d4c4e9a3:

    # c "One I didn't think I'd be able to handle, to be honest."
    c "说实话，我原本以为自己无法胜任。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:537
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_f16bcf75:

    # c "In the moment, all of the choices I've made seemed to make so much sense."
    c "在那一刻，我做出的所有选择似乎都那么合理。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:539
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_a1f24e4a:

    # c "Pulling the trigger on Garomph just seemed the right thing to do."
    c "对加罗姆夫扣动扳机似乎就是正确的选择。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:540
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_2a5d9eb0_1:

    # c "The same goes for what happened back in Tand."
    c "在坦德发生的事也是如此。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:542
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_4c72984c_1:

    # c "Tand being a prime example."
    c "坦德就是个典型例子。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:543
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_c43f47a3:

    # c "We had the intel from Arlya, going into a potentially high-risk situation, so lethal force seemed logical."
    c "我们当时有阿尔雅提供的情报，面对潜在的高风险局面，所以使用致命武力似乎合乎逻辑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:544
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_01b9b2f3:

    # c "The doubts always come afterwards...."
    c "疑虑总是在事后袭来……"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:545
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_99c99954:

    # "Jade stepped closer and offered me her embrace."
    "杰德走近一步，向我张开双臂。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:547
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_405ee3bc_1:

    # "As we both appreciated our closeness, Jade leaned in to me."
    "当我们都沉浸在这份亲密中时，杰德向我依偎过来。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:549
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_251e5cfe:

    # j "I just don't want you to lose yourself and I don't want to lose the man I love."
    j "我只是不想你迷失自我，也不想失去我爱的那个男人。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:550
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_38141ac1:

    # c "I'll do better next time."
    c "下次我会做得更好。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:552
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_a84b1c5f:

    # "Jade held me tighter in response, words evidently failing to convey the emotions she felt."
    "杰德闻言将我搂得更紧，言语显然无法传达她内心的情感。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:553
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_8439fd4e:

    # "We stood there for quite a while, the hum of the Bastard's engine the only audible sound."
    "我们在那儿站了很久，只有\"私生子\"号引擎的嗡鸣声清晰可闻。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:556
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_f67d65a9:

    # c "I am who I am."
    c "我就是我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:557
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_cc27c3fa:

    # c "If that doesn't align with your feelings for me, it might be better if we stopped seeing each other."
    c "如果这与你对我的感情不相符，或许我们不该再见面了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:559
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_5900def6:

    # j "What?!{w} No!"
    j "什么？！{w} 不！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:560
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_f1cb6cc1:

    # j "I'm just telling you I want the old you back, the man I fell in love with."
    j "我只是在告诉你，我想要从前的你回来，那个我爱上的男人。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:561
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_3be30852:

    # c "There's no old me."
    c "根本没有什么从前的我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:563
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_61675ffd:

    # c "Garomph deserved to die and I'm not going to explain myself again regarding our mission back in Tand."
    c "加罗姆夫该死，关于我们在坦德星的任务，我不会再解释第二遍。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:565
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_037e9d4c:

    # c "I'm not going to explain myself again regarding our mission back in Tand."
    c "关于我们在坦德星的任务，我不会再解释第二遍。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:566
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_5a6ced67:

    # c "I love you Jade, but if this is really how you think of me, we shouldn't be together."
    c "我爱你杰德，但如果你真是这么看我的，我们就不该在一起。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:568
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_3b12a6e6:

    # j "But [p_name]...{w} Don't you see?"
    j "但是[p_name]…{w}你难道不明白吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:569
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_b9b683a2:

    # j "If you go on like this, you'll become just like..."
    j "如果你继续这样下去，你会变得就像…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:570
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_d9e72175:

    # c "Don't you dare utter those words you were about to say."
    c "你敢把刚才想说的话说出来试试。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:571
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_12472056:

    # c "I'm nothing like my father and I never will be."
    c "我一点也不像我父亲，永远都不会。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:573
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_2a30b737:

    # j "But-"
    j "但是-"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:574
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_dac08859:

    # c "Get the fuck out of here!"
    c "给我滚出去！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:575
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_f9c12ce5:

    # c "Now!"
    c "现在！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:577
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_7a4424ef:

    # "Jade ran out of my quarters, tears streaking her face."
    "杰德哭着跑出我的舱室，脸上挂着泪痕。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:579
translate simplified_chinese ep015_jade_talk_941d8717:

    # "I sat on my bed and stared out into nothingness for a long time."
    "我坐在床上，长时间茫然地凝视着虚空。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:591
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a2ae1fb3:

    # l "Is Eva going to be okay?"
    l "伊娃会没事吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:592
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_718f119a:

    # c "Yes, she is, I've spoken to her."
    c "是的，她没事，我和她谈过了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:594
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_87bdfaba:

    # l "I found her lying on the floor of the simulation room, and for a split second I thought she'd died."
    l "我发现她躺在模拟室的地板上，有那么一瞬间我以为她死了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:596
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_cade5101:

    # l "Then, when I couldn't wake her up...{w} I was so scared."
    l "然后，当我无法唤醒她时…{w} 我害怕极了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:598
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e0ebcb57:

    # l "Why is that simulation room even operational?"
    l "那个模拟室为什么还在运行？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:599
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_97f1d33e:

    # c "It’s a place for the crew to unwind."
    c "那是船员放松的地方。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:601
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_59ada513:

    # l "Yeah, tell that to Eva..."
    l "是啊，把这话说给伊娃听吧…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:602
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_0e2f42e5:

    # c "Look, I-"
    c "听着，我-"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:604
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_c74e0ea8:

    # l "You know what, I don’t need to hear your justifications, and I don’t really care."
    l "你知道吗，我不需要听你的辩解，也根本不在乎。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:605
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_96c4b955:

    # l "Despite what anyone tells you, you’ll do whatever you like anyway, so..."
    l "不管别人对你说什么，你反正都会按自己的喜好行事，所以…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:606
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_851b74db:

    # "Lilly looked at me with hatred in her eyes."
    "莉莉用充满恨意的眼神瞪着我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:607
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_8f954e79:

    # "Her attitude obviously had to do with our recent breakup."
    "她这种态度显然和我们最近分手有关。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:611
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_51226cd7:

    # c "Is this how it’s going to be from now on?"
    c "以后就要一直这样了吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:612
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a00ade7e:

    # c "You being a bitch to me all the time?"
    c "你永远都要对我这么刻薄？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:614
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_3c9744c0:

    # l "What did you expect, you piece of shit?!"
    l "你还指望什么，你这人渣？！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:615
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a0955ceb:

    # l "Did you think I’d just act like nothing happened?"
    l "你以为我会当作什么都没发生过吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:616
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e6bf71aa:

    # c "No, but I was hoping we could behave like adults to each other."
    c "不，但我原本希望我们能像成年人一样对待彼此。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:617
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_12202b52:

    # l "Like you are even capable of that sort of thing."
    l "说得好像你真有这种能力似的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:618
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_f5f7c27d:

    # c "Right."
    c "行吧。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:619
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a5172ec1:

    # c "You know what, I’ll just leave you be."
    c "你知道吗，我就不打扰你了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:621
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e11e108c:

    # l "Yeah, fuck off, why don’t you?"
    l "是啊，你他妈还不快滚？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:623
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a5172ec1_1:

    # c "You know what, I’ll just leave you be."
    c "你知道吗，我就不打扰你了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:624
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_add51318:

    # l "Yeah, you do that."
    l "是啊，你请便。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:626
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_99d2c977:

    # l "Then, when I couldn't wake her up...{w} I was so scared, [p_name_short]."
    l "然后，当我怎么都叫不醒她时…{w}我真的吓坏了，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:627
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_3796ed7e:

    # c "I'm so sorry you had to go through all that."
    c "很抱歉你不得不经历这一切。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:628
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_f90678a8:

    # l "You mentioned she'd entered one of your sims by mistake?"
    l "你提到她不小心进入了你的某个模拟程序？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:629
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_47d08500:

    # c "Yes, I should have been more careful."
    c "是的，我本该更加小心的。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:631
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_ca322d20:

    # l "What kind of horror scenario did you leave behind?"
    l "你到底留下了什么样的恐怖场景？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:632
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_bab9124b:

    # l "I mean, it left her nearly catatonic."
    l "我是说，这让她几乎陷入了紧张性精神分裂状态。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:633
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_863da751:

    # c "I...{w} It was a sim of our home, with a virtual copy of Eva living in it."
    c "我…{w}那是我们家的模拟场景，里面住着伊娃的虚拟复制体。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:635
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a31f5870:

    # l "Why would you do something like that?"
    l "你为什么要做这种事？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:636
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_caf3f718:

    # c "Because I missed her terribly and we had no way of knowing she'd ever come back, before we found Erigone."
    c "因为我非常想念她，而且在发现厄里戈涅星之前，我们根本不知道她还能回来。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:637
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_da32991a:

    # c "After Erigone, I left the simulation there, because I couldn't bear to delete it."
    c "在厄里戈涅星之后，我把那个模拟程序留了下来，因为我实在不忍心删除它。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:638
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_47159af2:

    # c "From there, it must have spun out of control."
    c "从那时起，事情一定就失控了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:640
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_feb54388:

    # l "You can say that again."
    l "你说得一点没错。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:641
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_00c764bc:

    # l "You can be so stupid, you know that?"
    l "你知道吗，你有时候真的很蠢。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:643
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e69dbd10:

    # "Her barbed comment didn't have much of a sting and Lilly smiled at me after a while."
    "她带刺的评论并没有太多杀伤力，过了一会儿莉莉对我露出了微笑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:645
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e0f0d285:

    # "Lilly had sent me a message asking me to meet her in her quarters."
    "莉莉给我发了条信息，让我去她的舱室见她。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:647
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_ce6ef608:

    # "She was waiting for me, obviously a little nervous."
    "她正在等我，明显有点紧张。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:648
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_05d80ab6:

    # c "You rang, milady?"
    c "您召唤我，女士？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:650
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_b0d36c38:

    # "My comment made her smile a little."
    "我的话让她微微笑了笑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:653
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_794976f6:

    # "I smiled back at her."
    "我也对她报以微笑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:656
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_5e9cb7d8:

    # l "Don't do that!"
    l "别这样！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:657
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_5bc1adf0:

    # c "What?{w} Smile at you?"
    c "什么？{w}对你微笑吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:658
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_0a1c839b:

    # l "Yes.{w} No."
    l "是的。{w}不是。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:659
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_209c001e:

    # c "This is a little confusing."
    c "这有点让人困惑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:661
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_7e7f053f:

    # l "Shut up, before I change my mind."
    l "闭嘴，趁我还没改变主意。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:662
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_b9720d6c:

    # l "I've made a decision."
    l "我已经做了决定。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:664
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_c8eaf467:

    # l "Don't look at me like I've sprouted a second head."
    l "别像看怪物似的盯着我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:665
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_bd2b9b81:

    # c "Just a bit puzzled."
    c "只是有点困惑。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:667
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_d732b13a:

    # l "I've made a decision about us."
    l "关于我们俩的事，我已经做了决定。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:668
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_aa99fbb9:

    # c "Ah."
    c "啊。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:669
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_b9ee1c7f:

    # l "You know I'm not happy with the whole polyamory deal you seem to be proposing."
    l "你知道我对你提出的那种多角关系并不满意。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:671
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_77cae159:

    # l "It all seems to me you want the whole cake and eat it too..."
    l "在我看来你就是想鱼与熊掌兼得…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:672
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_9819b2d5:

    # "I really wanted to interject, but I held back, something told me that Lilly needed to get everything off her chest first."
    "我真的很想插话，但还是忍住了，直觉告诉我莉莉需要先把心里话都说完。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:673
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_ef8c25ed:

    # l "The simple fact is that I don't want to lose you."
    l "简单来说就是我不想失去你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:674
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_1c4b3ad5:

    # l "I love you and I know you love me."
    l "我爱你，我知道你也爱我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:675
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_0314fcf2:

    # l "If that means I have to share you with other women..."
    l "如果这意味着我必须与其他女人分享你…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:677
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_0192dcd4:

    # l "So, if you truly think this can work, I'd like us to try."
    l "所以，如果你真心认为这能行得通，我希望我们能试试。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:679
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_79ae72d4:

    # l "I don't want to rush into anything and I'll put a stop to all of this when it makes me feel too uncomfortable."
    l "我不想仓促行事，如果这让我感到太不舒服，我会叫停这一切。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:681
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_b5e027d4:

    # l "Also, I'd like to have you for my own from time to time."
    l "另外，我希望偶尔能独占你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:683
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_67c1f809:

    # l "Does that work for you?"
    l "你觉得这样可以吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:684
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_f3cc8ad7:

    # c "Of course it does."
    c "当然可以。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:685
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_22130ee2:

    # c "You don't know how happy this makes me!"
    c "你不知道这让我有多开心！"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:687
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_93c2aa1a:

    # l "I can imagine..."
    l "我能想象…"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:689
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_c065509c:

    # l "You’re getting the best deal of your life, aren’t you?"
    l "你可是捡了天大的便宜，对吧？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:690
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_df113d3d:

    # c "I'd just really like to kiss you right now."
    c "我现在真的很想吻你。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:692
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_37f5648e:

    # l "I'll allow it."
    l "我允许了。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:695
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_2a0de5bf:

    # l "So, here's the deal."
    l "那么，我们来谈个条件。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:696
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_00081be9:

    # l "I want us to continue our relationship."
    l "我希望我们能继续这段关系。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:697
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_7a583ee5:

    # l "Completely, without reservations."
    l "完完全全地，毫无保留地。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:698
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_7925d07c:

    # l "Whatever side-shows you've got going on, I don't want to hear about them."
    l "你在外面那些风流韵事，我一个字都不想听。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:699
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_d14e86e6:

    # l "When you're with me, you're mine and I don't want to hear about your conquests or anything remotely related to other relationships."
    l "当你和我在一起时，你就是我的，我不想听到关于你的猎艳经历或任何与其他关系沾边的事。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:700
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_8bfff6af:

    # l "As far as I'm concerned, I'm the only one for you and I want to be blissfully unaware of the others."
    l "在我看来，我就是你的唯一，我希望自己能幸福地不知道其他人的存在。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:701
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_7963cf59:

    # c "Understood."
    c "明白。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:703
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_67c1f809_1:

    # l "Does that work for you?"
    l "这样你能接受吗？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:704
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_20f81dee:

    # c "If it means continuing our relationship, then yes of course."
    c "如果这意味着能继续我们的关系，那当然可以。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:706
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_d0e910e3:

    # l "Good."
    l "很好。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:708
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_3e9731ce:

    # l "I really want to be kissed now."
    l "我现在真的很想被亲吻。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:711
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_a2f7b336:

    # l "Oh no, mister, I know what you're doing."
    l "噢不，先生，我知道你在打什么主意。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:712
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_297d93f3:

    # c "What?"
    c "什么？"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:713
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_467db4f2:

    # l "You're trying to butter me up with that rakish smile of yours."
    l "你正试图用那轻浮的笑容来讨好我。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:715
translate simplified_chinese ep015_lilly_talk_e5267ff9:

    # c "I'm just smiling at you, showing a token of my brotherly love."
    c "我只是在对您微笑，表达我兄弟般的关爱。"

# game/episode015_conversations.rpy:717
